{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8bedcb37-db0e-11ef-a356-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8bedcafb-db0e-11ef-8771-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":1,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"絳水","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"高二尺爲一版；三版，六尺。","note_content_jianti_auto":"高二尺为一版；三版，六尺。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8bedcafc-db0e-11ef-94f5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"顏師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"颜师古","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8bedcafe-db0e-11ef-94db-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"史游","people_name_jianti_auto":"史游","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8bedcaff-db0e-11ef-867e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陸佃","people_name_jianti_auto":"陆佃","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb00-db0e-11ef-9db6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"沈，持林翻。顏師古漢書音義曰：鼃，黽也，似蝦蟇而長脚，其色青。史游急就章曰：蛙，蝦蟇。陸佃埤雅曰：鼃，似蝦蟇而長踦，瞋目如怒。鼃，與蛙同，音下媧翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"沈，持林翻。颜师古汉书音义曰：鼃，黾也，似虾蟇而长脚，其色青。史游急就章曰：蛙，虾蟇。陆佃埤雅曰：鼃，似虾蟇而长踦，瞋目如怒。鼃，与蛙同，音下娲翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8bedcafd-db0e-11ef-be6f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"據經典釋文，凡巡行之行，音下孟翻；後倣此。","note_content_jianti_auto":"据经典释文，凡巡行之行，音下孟翻；后倣此。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb04-db0e-11ef-8493-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"智氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"智氏","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb07-db0e-11ef-87d5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"燭庸之越","people_name_jianti_auto":"烛庸之越","start_index":93,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb08-db0e-11ef-8bb4-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"杜預","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜预","start_index":100,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb09-db0e-11ef-8518-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"韓","place_name_jianti_auto":"韩","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb0a-db0e-11ef-9073-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb0b-db0e-11ef-bdf0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb0c-db0e-11ef-94db-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb0d-db0e-11ef-b76b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"兵車，尊者居左，執弓矢；御者居中；有力者居右，持矛以備傾側，所謂車右是也。韓、魏畏智氏之強，一爲之御，一爲之右。驂，與參同，參者，三也。三人同車則曰驂乘，四人同車則曰駟乘。左傳：齊伐晉，燭庸之越駟乘。杜預註曰：四人共乘者殿車。乘，石證翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"兵车，尊者居左，执弓矢；御者居中；有力者居右，持矛以备倾侧，所谓车右是也。韩、魏畏智氏之强，一为之御，一为之右。骖，与参同，参者，三也。三人同车则曰骖乘，四人同车则曰驷乘。左传：齐伐晋，烛庸之越驷乘。杜预注曰：四人共乘者殿车。乘，石证翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb06-db0e-11ef-9179-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb11-db0e-11ef-8365-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"應劭","people_name_jianti_auto":"应劭","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"8bedcb12-db0e-11ef-87b5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"魏絳","people_name_jianti_auto":"魏绛","start_index":83,"ton